cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts, please cite the article below."
title: "Medicago Xenium Relabeling and Resegmentation"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-09"
abstract: >-
  Batch scripts for processing Medicago truncatula root nodule Xenium in situ
  datasets with Xenium Ranger 4.0.1.1: relabeling raw output bundles with the
  study gene panel, then importing H&E-derived cell masks with the Xenium
  nuclei and an H&E-to-Xenium coordinate transform (resegmentation).
